# Buys nothing per level, and is meant to. Nothing in this game inflicts an
# abnormal condition, so there is none to lift -- the skill is here because the
# boss that needs it and the Vengeance form that answers it are both still to
# come. The flag is what its page states instead of calling it empty.
name: "Dispel"
description: "Removes the abnormal conditions afflicting you."
kind: SKILL_KIND_PASSIVE
tags: SKILL_TAG_BENEVOLENCE
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_PRIEST skill_order: 4 }
max_level: 10
base { cures_conditions: true }
